          "_name": "content4",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content4\" group=\"Content\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video'&&bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"10\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background13.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"title col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\"><b>How GlucoFlush Works?\n</b><div><b><br></b></div></h3>\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle align-center mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">MindSilence™ is presented as a daily wellness supplement designed to support a calmer mind, emotional balance, relaxation, and mental well-being. The idea behind the formula is to provide nutritional support for the body’s natural processes involved in managing everyday stress and maintaining a balanced mental state.<br><br>\n<div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>Modern lifestyles can expose people to constant stimulation from work, screens, responsibilities, and daily pressures. This can sometimes make it difficult to relax or maintain a sense of mental calm. MindSilence™ is designed to complement healthy habits by supplying ingredients intended to support the nervous system and overall relaxation.</div><br><div><b>Supports a Calm Mental State</b></div><div>MindSilence™ is formulated around the goal of helping promote a more relaxed state of mind. By supporting the body’s natural relaxation mechanisms, it may be useful as part of a daily routine for people who want to feel calmer and less mentally overwhelmed.</div><br><div><b>Helps Support Stress Management</b></div><div>\n</div><div>Everyday stress can affect mood, concentration, sleep routines, and general well-being. MindSilence™ is marketed as nutritional support for maintaining balance during periods of normal daily stress. It is not intended to diagnose, treat, or cure a medical condition.</div><br><div><b>Supports Mental Focus and Clarity</b></div><div>A busy or distracted mind can make it harder to concentrate on everyday tasks. MindSilence™ is intended to support a balanced mental environment, which may help users maintain focus and mental clarity as part of a healthy lifestyle.</div><div><br></div><div><b>Complements a Healthy Daily Routine</b></div><div>MindSilence™ works best as part of an overall wellness routine rather than as a standalone solution. Regular physical activity, nutritious food, sufficient sleep, hydration, and relaxation practices can all contribute to better mental well-being.</div><br><div>The precise mechanism of MindSilence™ depends on its actual ingredients, amounts, and formulation. Since formulas can vary, the product label and manufacturer’s official information should be checked for the most accurate details about ingredients, recommended use, and specific claims.</div><div><br></div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div></h4>\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn align-center\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\">LEARN MORE</a>\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary-outline\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\">LIVE DEMO</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
