          "_name": "content4",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content4\" group=\"Content\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video'&&bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"11\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"title col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\">\n                    <b>How Does Quietum Plus Works?</b></h3>\n                <h2 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle align-center mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><br></span></div><div><b>MindSilence™ </b>is marketed as a dietary supplement formulated to support everyday mental and nervous-system wellness. Its potential benefits are generally associated with the nutrients and botanical ingredients included in the formula.</div><div><br><div>✅<b>Supports a Calm Mind–</b>&nbsp;MindSilence™ is designed to promote relaxation and help support a more balanced mental state during everyday periods of stress and mental busyness.</div><div><br></div></div><div><div>✅<b>Promotes Relaxation&nbsp;–</b>&nbsp;Ingredients such as passion flower and valerian are traditionally used in relaxation-focused formulas, making them suitable for supporting a calm daily routine.</div></div><div><div><br></div><div>✅<b>Supports Healthy Sleep&nbsp;–</b>&nbsp;A calmer evening routine may make it easier to unwind before bedtime. MindSilence™ is marketed as nutritional support for relaxation and restful nighttime habits.</div><div><br></div></div><div><div>✅<b>Supports Mental Focus&nbsp;–</b>&nbsp;The formula provides nutrients associated with normal nervous-system function and is promoted for supporting concentration and everyday mental clarity.</div><div><br></div><div>✅<b>Supports Nervous-System Health&nbsp;–</b>&nbsp;Vitamin B6, zinc, and taurine contribute to normal physiological functions involving the nervous system, helping provide foundational nutritional support.</div><div><br></div></div><div><div>✅<b>Supports Brain Wellness&nbsp;–</b>&nbsp;MindSilence™ combines vitamins, minerals, botanical extracts, amino acids, and probiotics to provide broad nutritional support for overall brain and cognitive wellness.</div></div><div><div><br></div></div><div><div>✅<b>Supports Gut-Brain Wellness –&nbsp;</b>The included probiotic blend is intended to support a healthy gut microbiome. Gut health is also an area of ongoing research in relation to overall mental well-being.</div></div><br><div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><b>✅Supports Daily Well-Being – </b>With a combination of nutritional and botanical ingredients, MindSilence™ can be incorporated into a broader wellness routine focused on relaxation, healthy habits, and everyday mental balance.</span></div></div></h2>\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn align-center\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\">LEARN MORE</a>\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary-outline\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\">LIVE DEMO</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
